                <pb facs="0662" n="640" xml:id="pg640"/>
                <p rendition="#flush">I. <hi rendition="#italic">Records of Previous
                    Meetings</hi></p>
                <p>The Council approved the records of its 19th, 20th, 21st and 22nd Meetings.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">II. <hi rendition="#italic">Newt Meeting of the
                    Council</hi></p>
                <p>It was agreed to hold a private meeting on the same day at 9:45 p.m., in the
                    office, and under the chairmanship of Mr. Byrnes.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">III. <hi rendition="#italic">Further Work of the
                    Deputies</hi></p>
                <p>It was agreed that the Deputies would examine the questions still outstanding in
                    the draft treaty with Finland and report to the Council.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">IV. <hi rendition="#italic">Draft Treaty With Roumania</hi>.
                    (C.F.M. (D) (46) 182).<anchor n="35" xml:id="d207-f1"/></p>
                <p>1. <hi rendition="#italic">Danube</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views on the texts proposed by the U.K. Delegation
                    (C.F.M.(46) 148)<anchor n="36" xml:id="d207-f2"/> and by the Soviet Delegation
                    (C.F.M.(46) 135),<anchor n="37" xml:id="d207-f3"/> the Council decided to
                    adjourn the discussion of this question.</p>
                <p>2. <hi rendition="#italic">Restitution</hi> (Art. 23 and Appendix I, Part II, 1,
                        2)<anchor n="38" xml:id="d207-f4"/></p>
                <p>Referred back to the Deputies for further discussion on the wording proposed by
                    the Soviet Delegation namely: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The Roumanian Government and the Government entitled to restitution may
                            conclude agreements to take the place of the provisions of the present
                            article”,</p></quote></p>
                <p rendition="#flush">to be inserted after the text proposed by the U.S. Delegation
                    and contained in para. 1 of Part II.</p>
                <p>3. <hi rendition="#italic">United Nations</hi> (Appendix II, Part 111, 5.)<anchor
                        n="39" xml:id="d207-f5"/></p>
                <p>The Council instructed the Economic Committee to submit a report on this question
                    by 27th June.</p>
                <p>4. <hi rendition="#italic">General economic clauses</hi>. (Article 33.)<anchor
                        n="40" xml:id="d207-f6"/></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, the Council decided to adjourn the discussion of this
                    question.</p>
